WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:06.500
Your world in Mimir: every entry, with its art.

2
00:00:06.500 --> 00:00:13.200
Create a new entry: a character called Göndul.

3
00:00:13.200 --> 00:00:26.800
Connect it: type [[ and pick Óðinn. The link is saved in the markdown file.

4
00:00:26.800 --> 00:00:33.800
Open Óðinn. Every link and relationship is gathered in one place.

5
00:00:33.800 --> 00:00:40.400
The family tree draws itself from those links.

6
00:00:40.400 --> 00:00:46.400
The relationships graph shows every typed bond in the world.

7
00:00:46.400 --> 00:00:51.700
Maps hold pins that link back to entries.

8
00:00:51.700 --> 00:00:57.300
The timeline uses the world's own calendar.

9
00:00:57.300 --> 00:01:04.700
Ask Mimir a question about your own world.

